    {
      "id": "2122157102164775348",
      "text": "Victor Olofsson on the power play and #VGK is on the board. Heck of a pass from Hertl to set up a wide open net for Vic. 2-1 Vancouver.",
      "url": "https://x.com/RyanHockeyGuy/status/2122157102164775348",
      "published": "2026-11-16T02:37:35+00:00",
      "likes": 8,
      "author": "Ryan The Hockey Guy",
      "handle": "RyanHockeyGuy",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2111544472022732800/4TCIFE2w_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "It's 2-0 Vancouver. The Canucks just took a delay of game penalty. A power play goal for the Golden Knights would be great right now.",
      "quoted_author": "Ryan The Hockey Guy",
      "quoted_handle": "RyanHockeyGuy"
    },
    {
      "id": "2122157044774105465",
      "text": "Great passing to set up Olofsson's seventh of the year. That's now an 11-game point streak at home for Marner. https://t.co/Q8n62GTj6J",
